      "writtenOn": "2017-02-08T15:33:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point! Is that really a corner case? As the alarm-deleted messages are sent after the alarm-definition-deleted event, I wonder whether this could happen quite frequently when Monasca is used under production load.\n\nAnyway I believe that the thresholder should really clean-up the alarms, because it cannot be ensured that the API will have a complete list of alarms before the thresholder has processed the alarm-definition-deletion message.\n\nSo what exactly is the reason why MetricFilteringBolt.deleteAlarmDefinition is not calling removeAlarm() for all metric-definitions (line 207-209)?",
      "parentUuid": "1a430d35_f995c332",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 219,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 219,
        "endChar": 36
      },
